From 6959196f9af78cebc0a06ae960f047b968eead27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:22:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Execution policies: identifiers as constant expressions

The identifiers of the policies, except the one of the Kokkos policies,
are constant expressions: the symbol exporting the identifier of the policy
expected by a library is then initialized statically, as the symbols giving
its backend and its memory space, instead of when the library is loaded.
The name of the execution space of Kokkos is not a constant expression with
all the versions of Kokkos.
---
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/CUDABackendExecutionPolicy.hxx    | 2 +-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/HIPBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx     | 2 +-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/KokkosBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx  | 5 ++++-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/OpenACCBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx | 2 +-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/OpenMPBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx  | 2 +-
 .../GenericParallel/ParallelSTLBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx    | 2 +-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/RAJABackendExecutionPolicy.hxx    | 2 +-
 .../MFront/GenericParallel/SyclBackendExecutionPolicy.hxx    | 2 +-
 8 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mfront/include/MFront/GenericParallel/CUDABackendExecutionPolicy.hxx b/mfront/include/MFront/GenericParallel/CUDABackendExecutionPolicy.hxx
index 0a305f32a..ac5c6c6da 100644
--- a/mfront/include/MFront/GenericParallel/CUDABackendExecutionPolicy.hxx
